{#- EnergyForecasting: the readings are made available to the recipient, by the grid
    operator directly or through the community, for the recipient's own research and
    the training of forecasting models, as an independent controller. A trained model
    is not retrained after withdrawal, and the text says so. `noun` and `plural` are how
    an access offer this one requires names it. -#}
{% import 'consent-texts/1.0/common.j2' as c with context %}
{% set plural = true %}

{% macro title(lang, offer, recipient) %}
{{- 'Creazione di modelli di previsione dei consumi' if lang == 'it' else 'Building consumption forecasting models' -}}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro noun(lang) %}
{{- 'la sua ricerca e i suoi modelli di previsione' if lang == 'it' else 'its research and forecasting models' -}}
{% endmacro %}

{% macro body(lang, offer, recipient) %}
{% set role = c.role(lang, recipient) %}
{% if lang == 'it' %}
Autorizzo che le mie misure ({{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'brief') }}) siano rese disponibili a {{ c.name(recipient) }}, da {{ dso.short }} direttamente o tramite {{ rec.short }}. {{ recipient.short }} {% if role %}{{ role }} e, per questo scopo, {% endif %}le usa come titolare autonomo per la propria ricerca e per addestrare modelli di previsione dell'energia, compresi modelli di base («foundation model»).
Attenzione: un modello già addestrato con i miei dati non viene riaddestrato dopo la revoca. Dopo la revoca i miei dati non sono più usati per nuovi addestramenti né per altre nuove elaborazioni.
{{ c.optional(lang) }}.
{% else %}
I allow my readings ({{ c.readings(lang, offer, 'brief') }}) to be made available to {{ c.name(recipient) }}, by {{ dso.short }} directly or through {{ rec.short }}. {{ recipient.short }} {% if role %}{{ role }} and, for this purpose, {% endif %}uses them as an independent controller for its own research and to train energy forecasting models, including foundation models.
Please note: a model already trained with my data is not retrained after I withdraw. After withdrawal my data is no longer used for new training or any other new processing.
{{ c.optional(lang) }}.
{% endif %}
{% endmacro %}
